  "body_mappings": [
    {
      "section": "en",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": [
        37.0,
        498.6614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        597.6614173228347
      ],
      "text": "In July 1964, inspecting rice ear by ear in a paddy at Anjiang Agricultural School in Hunan province, the instructor Yuan Longping spotted a peculiar plant. It was male-sterile, shedding no viable pollen. Rice pollinates itself, so breeding hybrid seed in bulk depends on such plants. In February 1966 he detailed the anomaly in the journal Chinese Science Bulletin."
    },
    {
      "section": "en",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": [
        37.0,
        391.1614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        490.1614173228347
      ],
      "text": "The specimen launched a six-year hunt: Yuan and his colleagues could not breed a sterile line whose offspring reliably inherited the trait. The breakthrough came on 23 November 1970, in a marsh near Nanhong Farm in Sanya, Hainan. Yuan's assistant, Li Bihu, and Feng Keshan, a farm technician, found wild rice whose pollen was abortive."
    },
    {
      "section": "en",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": [
        37.0,
        263.8614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        382.6614173228347
      ],
      "text": "Then came Yuan's decisive move: rather than withhold the strain, he distributed it to collaborators nationwide. Hybrids need three distinct lines: a sterile line, one to maintain its sterility, and one to restore fertility in the hybrids. Yan Longan's team in Jiangxi bred sterile lines and Zhang Xiancheng in Guangxi first identified a restorer line. In October 1973, at a national conference in Suzhou, Yuan declared the three-line system complete."
    },
    {
      "section": "en",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": [
        37.0,
        176.16141732283472,
        461.8976377952756,
        255.3614173228347
      ],
      "text": "By 1976 hybrids were under cultivation on about 140,000 hectares. The World Food Prize Foundation estimates that hybrid rice can yield up to a fifth more grain than conventional varieties. By the early 2000s it covered almost half of China's rice fields."
    },
    {
      "section": "en",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": [
        37.0,
        88.46141732283472,
        461.8976377952756,
        167.66141732283472
      ],
      "text": "Yuan, who shared the 2004 World Food Prize with Sierra Leone's Monty Jones, died in Changsha on 22 May 2021, aged 91. Yet popular myth portrays him as a solitary genius. His eye began the search; his generosity let many hands bring in the harvest."
    },
    {
      "section": "zh",
      "page": 3,
      "bbox": [
        37.0,
        517.6614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        597.6614173228347
      ],
      "text": "1964年7月，一穗一穗地检查水稻时，在湖南省安江农校的一块稻田里，教员袁隆平发现了一株奇特的/奇怪的稻子。它是雄性不育株，散播不出能生长发育的花粉。水稻自花授粉，所以，要大批地培育杂交种子，就得靠这样的植株。1966年2月，他详细描述了这一反常现象，文章发表在期刊《科学通报》上。"
    },
    {
      "section": "zh",
      "page": 3,
      "bbox": [
        37.0,
        429.1614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        509.1614173228347
      ],
      "text": "这株标本开启了一场长达六年的搜寻：袁隆平和同事们始终培育不出一个不育系，其后代能稳定地遗传这一性状。突破出现在1970年11月23日，地点是一片沼泽，在海南三亚南红农场附近。袁隆平的助手李必湖和农场技术员冯克珊找到了一种野生稻，它的花粉败育。"
    },
    {
      "section": "zh",
      "page": 3,
      "bbox": [
        37.0,
        320.6614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        420.6614173228347
      ],
      "text": "随后，袁隆平迈出了决定性的一步：而非扣留这个品系在自己手里，他把它分给全国各地的协作者。杂交稻需要三个各不相同的系：不育系，保持其不育性的保持系，以及使杂交种恢复育性的恢复系。颜龙安的团队在江西育成了不育系，张先程在广西率先找出了恢复系。1973年10月，在苏州召开的全国性会议上，袁隆平宣布三系已经配套。"
    },
    {
      "section": "zh",
      "page": 3,
      "bbox": [
        37.0,
        252.16141732283472,
        461.8976377952756,
        312.1614173228347
      ],
      "text": "到1976年，杂交水稻已经处于大面积种植，占地面积大约140000公顷。据世界粮食奖基金会估计，杂交稻比常规品种最多可多产五分之一的稻谷。到21世纪初，杂交稻已覆盖近一半的中国稻田。"
    },
    {
      "section": "zh",
      "page": 3,
      "bbox": [
        37.0,
        183.66141732283472,
        461.8976377952756,
        243.66141732283472
      ],
      "text": "袁隆平曾与塞拉利昂的蒙蒂·琼斯共获2004年世界粮食奖，2021年5月22日在长沙逝世，享年91岁。然而，一种流传甚广的错误的观点把他描绘成一个单枪匹马的天才。他的慧眼开启了这场搜寻；他的慷慨，让许多双手一起迎来了丰收。"
    }
  ],
